      <activity id="d8547a29-caa6-57e4-a979-a7939dcf91cc" activityNameId="93fef749-d086-5007-b3ce-119e0f9be71c" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Helium, gaseous, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Helium, gaseous, at plant
The module reflects the production of helium from natural gas.  The processed natural gas input and output is not included in the inventory. Further included is the liquefaction of the product gas and the transport to a cylinder filling centre within Europe, where the gas is evaporated and compressed into cylinders.;
CAS number: 007440-59-7; 
Formula: He; 
UUID: 30d17e0e-4d9a-36fc-92a8-10ec495219ac
The module includes the most important energy demand and resources used for production, the transport to a cylinder filling centres and an estimation for infrastructure.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Helium extraction from natural gas. Refining to grade A helium with pressure swing adsorption (PSA). Liquefaction and transport to cylinder filling centres within Europe. Natural gas used for compression work in cooling processes.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: 25200 t
Sampling: based on literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_30d17e0e-4d9a-36fc-92a8-10ec495219ac.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
